WEBVTT

1
00:00:46.291 --> 00:00:48.750
In the 19th verse, it's stated that

2
00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:51.083
those who maintain an equal vision

3
00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:53.875
attain freedom from the cycle of birth and death

4
00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:55.875
in this very life...

5
00:00:55.875 --> 00:00:57.708
And from the 20th verse, Lord Krishna

6
00:00:57.708 --> 00:01:00.250
describes the qualities of those

7
00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:02.291
who see every situation with an equal

8
00:01:02.291 --> 00:01:03.708
vision

9
00:01:03.708 --> 00:01:06.250
and attain the Divine...

10
00:01:11.166 --> 00:01:14.000
In the 19th verse, Lord Krishna says,

11
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.583
one who sees every situation 
and being with equal vision...

12
00:01:18.583 --> 00:01:21.833
becomes free from the cycle of birth and death,

13
00:01:21.833 --> 00:01:23.375
experiencing liberation even while

14
00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:25.708
in this material world...

15
00:01:25.708 --> 00:01:28.500
When a person experiences the truth

16
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.166
that every aspect of the world is temporary,

17
00:01:31.166 --> 00:01:33.208
every being is equal...

18
00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:35.791
they become completely 
free from worldly attachments

19
00:01:35.791 --> 00:01:39.041
even while living in the world...

20
00:01:39.041 --> 00:01:40.208
Whether joy or sorrow,

21
00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:43.875
honor or dishonor, happiness

22
00:01:43.875 --> 00:01:45.166
or grief...

23
00:01:45.166 --> 00:01:48.125
their intellect remains steady in every situation...

24
00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:49.208
Such a person becomes liberated

25
00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:52.416
from the cycle of birth and death...

26
00:01:52.416 --> 00:01:53.375
Lord Krishna

27
00:01:53.375 --> 00:01:55.791
calls such a person "flawless"...

28
00:01:55.791 --> 00:01:58.208
One who abandons the world's faults,

29
00:01:58.208 --> 00:02:01.125
distinctions, and differences to view every being

30
00:02:01.125 --> 00:02:03.250
and every situation with equal

31
00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:04.708
vision...

32
00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:08.875
In their eyes, this entire creation
 is simply a part of the Divine...

33
00:02:08.875 --> 00:02:10.083
But the question

34
00:02:10.083 --> 00:02:14.291
arises, how is this state attained?

35
00:02:14.291 --> 00:02:16.125
Answering this question,

36
00:02:16.125 --> 00:02:18.916
Lord Krishna says in the 20th verse...

37
00:02:18.916 --> 00:02:22.958
The wise person knows that,
 just as the seasons cycle through

38
00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:26.666
rain, cold, and heat,

39
00:02:26.666 --> 00:02:31.208
similarly, joy and sorrow come and go in life...

40
00:02:31.208 --> 00:02:32.708
This material happiness and sorrow

41
00:02:32.708 --> 00:02:36.375
are like clouds in the sky...

42
00:02:36.375 --> 00:02:38.458
that come for a few moments

43
00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.000
and then depart...

44
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:42.750
One who accepts this truth...

45
00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:46.541
isn't disturbed by the ups and 
downs of the material world...

46
00:02:46.541 --> 00:02:47.708
and their soul

47
00:02:47.708 --> 00:02:50.125
remains established in eternal truth...

48
00:02:50.125 --> 00:02:52.708
But this doesn't mean such a person

49
00:02:52.708 --> 00:02:54.958
becomes detached from life...

50
00:02:54.958 --> 00:02:58.416
Rather, this knowledge teaches them
to live life with complete stability,

51
00:02:58.416 --> 00:03:02.208
equanimity, and peace...

52
00:03:02.208 --> 00:03:04.916
When a person realizes that material

53
00:03:04.916 --> 00:03:06.958
joys and sorrows are temporary

54
00:03:06.958 --> 00:03:09.875
and have no effect on the soul...

55
00:03:09.875 --> 00:03:13.666
then they become "steady-minded" 
and "undeluded"...

56
00:03:13.666 --> 00:03:15.458
And after gaining this knowledge,

57
00:03:15.458 --> 00:03:18.458
a person's peace and contentment

58
00:03:18.458 --> 00:03:21.958
don't depend on external circumstances... 
like praise or criticism,

59
00:03:21.958 --> 00:03:25.708
or success or failure...

60
00:03:25.708 --> 00:03:30.791
They depend on their inner 
equanimity and stability...!!

61
00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:38.125
Imagine

62
00:03:38.125 --> 00:03:40.583
you're standing by a calm

63
00:03:40.583 --> 00:03:44.500
and deep river,

64
00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:46.541
you see

65
00:03:46.541 --> 00:03:50.916
no movement on its surface...

66
00:03:50.916 --> 00:03:58.583
Would you consider the river dead 
because of its stillness...??

67
00:03:58.583 --> 00:04:00.583
No...!!

68
00:04:00.583 --> 00:04:04.500
To know the river's vitality,

69
00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:07.750
you must descend into its depths...

70
00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:10.541
Then you'll discover

71
00:04:10.541 --> 00:04:14.125
that in its depths lies infinite life...

72
00:04:14.125 --> 00:04:17.125
a flow...!!!

73
00:04:17.125 --> 00:04:19.166
Similarly,

74
00:04:19.166 --> 00:04:21.708
to understand life's movement,

75
00:04:21.708 --> 00:04:23.666
you must descend into the inner depths

76
00:04:23.666 --> 00:04:26.958
of your soul...

77
00:04:26.958 --> 00:04:30.250
Sometimes in your life, a small

78
00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.958
success makes you touch the sky with joy...

79
00:04:33.958 --> 00:04:37.666
And sometimes a small failure causes

80
00:04:37.666 --> 00:04:42.916
a storm of sorrow to surge within you...

81
00:04:42.916 --> 00:04:46.458
This cycle of material happiness and sorrow is

82
00:04:46.458 --> 00:04:51.541
the cause of your suffering and discontent!!

83
00:04:51.541 --> 00:04:53.750
Remember...

84
00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:58.208
What is unstable can never be happy...

85
00:04:58.208 --> 00:05:02.916
You must rise above these waves 
of material joy and sorrow

86
00:05:02.916 --> 00:05:06.625
that disturb you in every situation...

87
00:05:06.625 --> 00:05:10.916
Just as a sailor isn't disturbed by
 the ocean's waves...

88
00:05:10.916 --> 00:05:14.833
He crosses the ocean's waves

89
00:05:14.833 --> 00:05:18.708
with experience and self-control...

90
00:05:18.708 --> 00:05:24.416
In the same way, view every life situation

91
00:05:24.416 --> 00:05:25.541
with peace,

92
00:05:25.541 --> 00:05:28.958
restraint, and equal vision...

93
00:05:28.958 --> 00:05:30.958
This doesn't mean

94
00:05:30.958 --> 00:05:33.958
you become emotionless...

95
00:05:33.958 --> 00:05:37.291
It means you accept

96
00:05:37.291 --> 00:05:40.958
that your peace is within you...

97
00:05:40.958 --> 00:05:43.375
When you accept this,

98
00:05:43.375 --> 00:05:45.208
you don't get disturbed

99
00:05:45.208 --> 00:05:46.833
in difficult situations...

100
00:05:46.833 --> 00:05:50.291
And you remain stable,

101
00:05:50.291 --> 00:05:53.291
peaceful, and controlled in your life journey...

102
00:05:53.291 --> 00:05:57.166
This peace and equality lets you experience

103
00:05:57.166 --> 00:06:00.250
a divine power within you...

104
00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:05.875
This itself is your path to 
happiness and peace...!!

105
00:06:11.166 --> 00:06:14.166
When in family life 

106
00:06:14.166 --> 00:06:18.000
in both happy and sad situations...

107
00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:21.583
you keep your mind peaceful and stable

108
00:06:21.583 --> 00:06:23.583
And solve difficult situations

109
00:06:23.583 --> 00:06:28.125
without getting disturbed...

110
00:06:28.125 --> 00:06:31.500
This peace and stability of yours

111
00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.458
inspires the younger generation...

112
00:06:34.458 --> 00:06:36.500
Small children at home

113
00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.583
gain knowledge of inner peace

114
00:06:38.583 --> 00:06:40.708
from you...

115
00:06:40.708 --> 00:06:44.250
Let's understand with an example...

116
00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:47.875
Imagine, in a family, a father's

117
00:06:47.875 --> 00:06:51.625
business didn’t work...

118
00:06:51.625 --> 00:06:53.958
But the children see that

119
00:06:53.958 --> 00:06:58.666
instead of becoming sad and hopeless,

120
00:06:58.666 --> 00:07:02.333
the father is patiently looking 
for new opportunities...

121
00:07:02.333 --> 00:07:05.291
This stability teaches children

122
00:07:05.291 --> 00:07:09.083
that adverse circumstances come in life,

123
00:07:09.083 --> 00:07:13.333
but staying calm and stable is necessary

124
00:07:13.333 --> 00:07:15.833
to solve them...

125
00:07:15.833 --> 00:07:19.166
When younger family members see

126
00:07:19.166 --> 00:07:22.916
that in both joyful and sorrowful situations...

127
00:07:22.916 --> 00:07:26.750
the elders remain calm and stable

128
00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:30.500
Neither does success disturb their inner peace

129
00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.458
nor failure...

130
00:07:32.458 --> 00:07:35.625
Then the young generation of the family

131
00:07:35.625 --> 00:07:37.083
gains knowledge of spiritual peace

132
00:07:37.083 --> 00:07:39.666
and stability from this...

133
00:07:39.666 --> 00:07:40.583
This knowledge

134
00:07:40.583 --> 00:07:42.791
gives them the vision to see every situation

135
00:07:42.791 --> 00:07:46.375
with equality...

136
00:07:46.375 --> 00:07:48.708
It teaches them

137
00:07:48.708 --> 00:07:51.208
that their happiness and contentment

138
00:07:51.208 --> 00:07:54.750
don't depend on material joys and sorrows...

139
00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:57.458
But depend on their inner strength

140
00:07:57.458 --> 00:08:00.708
and mental stability...

141
00:08:00.708 --> 00:08:03.958
When you remain peaceful and stable

142
00:08:03.958 --> 00:08:05.750
in every situation,

143
00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.750
you control your emotions

144
00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:12.875
and give your responses thoughtfully...

145
00:08:12.875 --> 00:08:16.500
This prevents ideological differences in the family...

146
00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:19.708
And this inner peace and stability 

147
00:08:19.708 --> 00:08:21.166
not only for the family

148
00:08:21.166 --> 00:08:22.833
but also for society...

149
00:08:22.833 --> 00:08:25.375
is extremely important not only

150
00:08:25.375 --> 00:08:27.916
A society where every person

151
00:08:27.916 --> 00:08:31.458
views all with equal vision...

152
00:08:31.458 --> 00:08:36.166
that society moves toward unique progress...

153
00:08:41.208 --> 00:08:42.125
Leadership

154
00:08:42.125 --> 00:08:44.750
doesn't just mean

155
00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:48.833
your work skills are excellent

156
00:08:48.833 --> 00:08:51.750
or you have complete control over

157
00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:54.708
organization members...

158
00:08:54.708 --> 00:08:57.416
But that you resolve problems

159
00:08:57.416 --> 00:09:00.708
with peace and restraint

160
00:09:00.708 --> 00:09:03.875
in difficult situations...

161
00:09:03.875 --> 00:09:08.208
This is the mark of true leadership...

162
00:09:08.208 --> 00:09:10.083
Remember,

163
00:09:10.083 --> 00:09:12.250
in every workplace

164
00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:15.333
there comes a time

165
00:09:15.333 --> 00:09:19.291
when along with tasting success,

166
00:09:19.291 --> 00:09:23.416
you must also endure the deep pain of failure...

167
00:09:23.416 --> 00:09:24.458
But then

168
00:09:24.458 --> 00:09:28.791
keep your mind peaceful and stable...

169
00:09:28.791 --> 00:09:32.125
When you remain peaceful and stable

170
00:09:32.125 --> 00:09:35.375
without getting disturbed in difficult situations...

171
00:09:35.375 --> 00:09:37.875
you become like a pillar of strength

172
00:09:37.875 --> 00:09:40.791
for your colleagues...

173
00:09:40.791 --> 00:09:41.666
You not only

174
00:09:41.666 --> 00:09:43.791
handle the organization

175
00:09:43.791 --> 00:09:45.250
in difficult circumstances

176
00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:48.791
but also become a source of inspiration

177
00:09:48.791 --> 00:09:51.625
for its members...

178
00:09:51.625 --> 00:09:54.208
One who remains

179
00:09:54.208 --> 00:09:57.291
peaceful and controlled in every situation

180
00:09:57.291 --> 00:10:02.416
is victorious in every battle of life...

181
00:10:02.416 --> 00:10:06.458
When you remain peaceful and controlled

182
00:10:06.458 --> 00:10:07.833
in difficult situations...

183
00:10:07.833 --> 00:10:09.333
this ability

184
00:10:09.333 --> 00:10:12.625
shows your inner clarity...

185
00:10:12.625 --> 00:10:14.916
Which helps you make every decision

186
00:10:14.916 --> 00:10:16.916
thoughtfully,

187
00:10:16.916 --> 00:10:20.125
guide your organization properly

188
00:10:20.125 --> 00:10:23.875
in difficult situations,

189
00:10:23.875 --> 00:10:25.375
and your peace

190
00:10:25.375 --> 00:10:29.583
also reduces the stress of other members...

191
00:10:29.583 --> 00:10:34.208
When your mind and intellect 
are peaceful and stable,

192
00:10:34.208 --> 00:10:38.083
you stay away from workplace politics,

193
00:10:38.083 --> 00:10:41.583
rumors, and tensions

194
00:10:41.583 --> 00:10:43.083
while completing your work

195
00:10:43.083 --> 00:10:46.666
with truth and dedication...

196
00:10:46.666 --> 00:10:49.916
And this is the mindset

197
00:10:49.916 --> 00:10:54.208
that makes you worthy of 
successful leadership...!!!
